lenius\">Linus Hallenius</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Hammarby_IF_Fotboll\" title=\"Hammarby IF Fotboll\">Hammarby</a> (18 mål)</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Största&#160;hemmavinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Falkenbergs_FF\" title=\"Falkenbergs FF\">Falkenberg</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://svenskfotboll.se/superettan/match/?scr=result&amp;fmid=1382850\">5–0</a> <a href=\"/wiki/FC_Trollh%C3%A4ttan\" title=\"FC Trollhättan\">Trollhättan</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(26 september 2010)</span> <br /> <a href=\"/wiki/GIF_Sundsvall\" title=\"GIF Sundsvall\">Sundsvall</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://svenskfotboll.se/superettan/match/?scr=result&amp;fmid=1382857\">5–0</a> <a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96sters_IF\" title=\"Östers IF\">Öster</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(4 oktober 2010)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Största&#160;bortavinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/FC_Trollh%C3%A4ttan\" title=\"FC Trollhättan\">Trollhättan</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://svenskfotboll.se/superettan/match/?scr=result&amp;fmid=1382760\">0–4</a> <a href=\"/wiki/IFK_Norrk%C3%B6ping\" title=\"IFK Norrköping\">Norrköping</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(17 juli 2010)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Flest mål i en match</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Degerfors_IF\" title=\"Degerfors IF\">Degerforis</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://svenskfotboll.se/superettan/tidigare-ar/resultat-2010/tabell-och-resultat/?scr=result&amp;fmid=1382879\">5–3</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ljungskile_SK\" title=\"Ljungskile SK\">Ljungskile</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-heigh